{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33638","headline":"送徐羣宰望江 · 邵谒","name":"送徐羣宰望江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古人力文学，所务安疲甿。\n今人力文学，所务惟公卿。\n大贤重邦本，屈迹官武城。\n劝民勤机杼，自然国用幷。\n但见富贵者，知食不知耕。\n忽尔秋不熟，储廪焉得盈。\n贡艺既精苦，用心必公平。\n吾道不遗贤，霄汉期芳馨。\n一夫若有德，千古称其英。\n陶潜虽理邑，崔烈徒台衡。\n浊者必恶清，瞽者必恶明。\n孤松自有色，岂夺衆草荣。\n爲刀若不利，焉得宰牛名。\n爲丝若不直，焉得琴上声。\n好去立高节，重来振羽翎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邵谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33638.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33638","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}